  "description": "Flexible rear dual shock absorbers, making the ride as smooth as walking on a flat surface\nGet instant torque and responsive acceleration that lets you climb, carve, and cruise with confidence.\nEquipped with a 48V 21Ah battery, the 2C delivers dependable range for trail sessions, cruising, or extended rides.\nDOT Hydraulic Brakes (3/4 System)\nReliable stopping power ensures safe and controlled braking, even when riding aggressively or on uneven terrain.\nMagnetic Kill Switch\nIntuitive, magnetic kill switch for the younger riders just starting out.\nTried and True Display\nIt shows important operating information like speed, mileage, battery capacity, timing, etc.\nHigh-Mounted Charging\nBlocks mud, dust, and water to reduce port wear and ensure a long-lasting, reliable connection.\nEverything you need. Nothing extra.\nPaired with a responsive horn, right where you expect it. No learning curve. Just ride.\nKey Ignition Switch\nConveniently located for quick access and enhanced security before every ride.",
